<p>
<br>
Looking at row 2, column 1, Branden Robinson
received 385 votes over Gergely Nagy.<br>
Looking at row 1, column 2, Gergely Nagy
received 55 votes over Branden Robinson.
</p>
	    <p>
<br>
  Option 2 defeats Option 1 by ( 385 - 55) = 330 votes.<br>
  Option 3 defeats Option 1 by ( 438 - 29) = 409 votes.<br>
  Option 4 defeats Option 1 by ( 258 - 144) = 114 votes.<br>
  Option 3 defeats Option 2 by ( 287 - 182) = 105 votes.<br>
  Option 2 defeats Option 4 by ( 394 - 70) = 324 votes.<br>
  Option 3 defeats Option 4 by ( 442 - 26) = 416 votes.
	    </p>
